{"id":"2bf2934e8ac23510","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-co-rp.md","title":"coRP","display":"df-co-rp — coRP","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-co-rp","aliases":["28-df-co-rp","coRP"],"display":"df-co-rp — coRP","depends_on":["[[28-df-rp]]"],"source_book_location":"§7.3; printed p.131; PDF p.157","source_printed_pages":"131","source_pdf_pages":"157","source_status":"statement-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-co-rp"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-co-rp</span><span>coRP</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-co-rp — coRP"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"efc30a60f20cb4de\" href=\"?note=efc30a60f20cb4de\" title=\"28-df-rp\">28-df-rp</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"§7.3; printed p.131; PDF p.157"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"131"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"157"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline L=\\Sigma^*\\setminus L\">\\(\\overline L=\\Sigma^*\\setminus L\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{RP}\">\\(\\mathbf{RP}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"efc30a60f20cb4de\" href=\"?note=efc30a60f20cb4de\" title=\"28-df-rp\">28-df-rp</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{coRP}\">\\(\\mathbf{coRP}\\)</span> 为待定义语言类。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{coRP}\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*:\\overline L\\in\\mathbf{RP}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{coRP}\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*:\\overline L\\in\\mathbf{RP}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对 RP 算法的输出取补，得到是实例接受概率 1、否实例接受概率至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1/2\">\\(1/2\\)</span> 的等价形式。补语言仅改变判定输出，不改变时间和随机位界。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-rp","status":"resolved","id":"efc30a60f20cb4de","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-rp]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-rp","status":"resolved","id":"efc30a60f20cb4de","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$\\overline L=\\Sigma^*\\setminus L$；$\\mathbf{RP}$ 见 [[28-df-rp]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline L=\\Sigma^*\\setminus L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{RP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{coRP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{coRP}\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*:\\overline L\\in\\mathbf{RP}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"1/2","display":false}],"bytes":811,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-114","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"概率机器与类：[[28-df-probabilistic-tm]]、[[28-df-bpp]]、[[28-df-rp]]、[[28-df-co-rp]]、[[28-df-zpp]]、[[28-df-pp]]。"},{"id":"b4f292ee2a50229e","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf{ZPP}$ 为 [[28-df-zpp]] 的零错误期望时间类，$\\mathbf{RP}$、$\\mathbf{coRP}$ 分别见 [[28-df-rp]]、[[28-df-co-rp]]。"}],"outgoing":["efc30a60f20cb4de"]}